WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.960 --> 00:00:06.150
In 2020, we made videos about.. the Game of
Thrones books, A Song of Ice and Fire – including

00:00:06.150 --> 00:00:10.340
Euron’s apocalypse, the Dorne plot, and
Dunk &amp; Egg.

00:00:10.340 --> 00:00:16.189
We covered Westworld Season 3, and the new
Watchmen, and Raised by Wolves, and The Expanse.

00:00:16.189 --> 00:00:21.369
We made a non-fiction video, about disaster
and religion and zombies.

00:00:21.369 --> 00:00:23.619
And there was that Cookie thing.

00:00:23.619 --> 00:00:28.890
In 2021, we'll keep making Song of Ice and
Fire videos – with more theories, recaps,

00:00:28.890 --> 00:00:29.890
and analysis.

00:00:29.890 --> 00:00:34.500
We’ll cover the Game of Thrones prequel
show when it comes, and hopefully someday,

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:37.190
we'll do The Winds of Winter too.

00:00:37.190 --> 00:00:42.030
And we’ll keep covering new series – they’re
making a show of Foundation by Isaac Asimov,

00:00:42.030 --> 00:00:44.060
so it’d be cool to talk about.

00:00:44.060 --> 00:00:45.629
We could do some His Dark Materials.

00:00:45.629 --> 00:00:49.199
Or American Gods, or The Boys, or more Expanse.

00:00:49.199 --> 00:00:54.059
They're making shows of Sandman, and The Stand,
and Y: The Last Man.

00:00:54.059 --> 00:00:57.679
There’s the Dune movie, and The Matrix 4
coming.

00:00:57.679 --> 00:01:00.249
We could go back and do Dark or Devs.

00:01:00.249 --> 00:01:04.300
And maybe more non-fiction videos, about history
and myth and stuff.

00:01:04.300 --> 00:01:06.360
There’s a lot to choose from.

00:01:06.360 --> 00:01:08.740
So we’re holding some votes on Patreon.

00:01:08.740 --> 00:01:13.119
There’s one vote to choose a Song of Ice
and Fire video topic, and one vote to choose

00:01:13.119 --> 00:01:14.420
a new series.

00:01:14.420 --> 00:01:19.630
These votes are open to all Patrons on all
tiers, and the votes close in a week.

00:01:19.630 --> 00:01:24.201
So for a few bucks, you can support Alt Shift
X, and help choose some new videos, at the

00:01:24.201 --> 00:01:25.201
link below.

00:01:25.201 --> 00:01:28.659
Either way, thank you for watching, and happy
new year.

00:01:28.659 --> 00:01:34.180
Special thanks to Patrons Cameron Weiss, Michael
Appell, Ryan Steele, Triangle Wine Company,

00:01:34.180 --> 00:01:40.049
Harry, Nikos Moraitakis, Shane Veglia, Brian
Sentient, Ria McDoodle, and Tim Cunniff.

00:01:40.049 --> 00:01:40.590
Cheers.

